window.EN={"1":"Father Oltoph, the enemy are survivors of the Kingdom of Leonster.","2":"And what's more, their commander appears to be Prince Leif, who escaped from Munster.","3":"This is no ordinary matter. I must report to the imperial army's general headquarters,","4":"so you hole up in this fortress and buy time!","5":"But General, the enemy has already penetrated inside the fortress.","6":"With us alone, we cannot possibly hold out...","7":"Hmm... It can't be helped. The last resort. Activate the Murder Holes.","8":"...The Murder Holes... Then you are telling us to die...","9":"If you can annihilate the enemy, you won't have to die. You do need to be prepared for it, though.","10":"Understood... If it is an order, it cannot be helped...","11":"Don't forget to dispose of the prisoners in the cells, either. If they manage to survive, it will be trouble later.","12":"Sir...","13":"I'm counting on you, then. Your deaths will never be in vain.","14":"......","15":"You're an imperial soldier! You devil! Did you come to kill us!?","16":"...No. I was captured... Why are you all here?","17":"Soldiers attacked our village... and we were brought here by force... What's going to happen to us...","18":"What's going to happen? It's obvious! We'll be made sacrifices to the dark god.","19":"We'll be sent to the capital at Belhalla, and everyone will be killed...","20":"My big sister was taken away too, and she never came back...","21":"I don't want that! I want to go back to the village... I want to see Mom and Dad...","22":"...Is this the child hunt? I'd heard rumors of it, but to think it's real...","23":"It's terrible, too terrible... You're telling me this is the doing of Friege, the country I believed in!","24":"Big sis, please! Help us!! Take us back to the village!!","25":"Yes. It's all right. Don't worry.","26":"I won't let them lay a hand on you. I'll protect you, no matter what. Even if it costs me my life...","27":"Lady Olwen! Where are you!! Please answer me!!","28":"Fred? You came... Over here, the children are with me!!","29":"But Kempf's soldiers are here too, so don't let your guard down!!","30":"Hmph. Order or not, as if I'd go along with something when I know full well it means dying!","31":"Something has come up that I must report to the commander. I'm going to the commander.","32":"Then I'll...","33":"It has to be me! I leave the rest to you.","34":"......","35":"It seems you helped the children. Who are you?","36":"And you are?","37":"I'm the leader of this army... My name is Leif.","38":"Leif? Then you are Prince Leif of Leonster?","39":"I am... I am Olwen, a mage knight of Friege.","40":"Of Friege? ...Then why...","41":"Where should I begin... So much has happened that I'm confused...","42":"If you would permit it, might I accompany you for a while, Prince?","43":"I don't mind, but... I must hear Dorias's and August's opinions too.","44":"Could you wait until the battle is over?","45":"Yes. I'm sorry for asking so much.","46":"Fred, I've decided to act together with these people.","47":"So you are free to...","48":"What are you saying! I am your adjutant, Lady Olwen.","49":"If that is what you have decided, I will simply follow.","50":"Fred... thank you.","51":"Lady Olwen!","52":"Fred... Thank you, you saved me...","53":"I'm glad you're safe... Quickly, let's escape... What's the matter? Your face is deathly pale.","54":"Fred, what have we been fighting for all this time...","55":"Lady Olwen, what on earth are you...","56":"What have I been doing until now? Helping to take small children from parents who've done nothing wrong?","57":"Or helping to send children to the capital at Belhalla to be made sacrifices?","58":"Lady Olwen...","59":"...Until now, I never once doubted what I was doing.","60":"I thought that as long as I just kept chasing after my brother's back, I couldn't go wrong.","61":"And yet... now I don't understand anything! I can't believe in anything! What on earth should I...","62":"...The only thing I can say is that the place you belong is not within the imperial army.","63":"Lady Olwen, let us join Prince Leif's army together.","64":"Prince Leif's? But until now they have always been our enemy...","65":"...I am acquainted with Prince Leif. His ideals are far closer to ours than the Empire's.","66":"What you have lost sight of, Lady Olwen... let us search for it in his army!","67":"...All right. If you go that far, Fred...","68":"Children here too... I understand well why the citizens of Tahra rose up.","69":"Indeed. And that is exactly why the Empire is desperate.","70":"If it lets Tahra off, similar revolts will break out everywhere.","71":"Corps are being gathered from every region to utterly crush a single city.","72":"There is even information that they have called the Gelben Ritter back from the capital.","73":"The Gelben Ritter... House Friege's royal guard corps.","74":"Yes. A mage knight order centered on the Friege family, and an elite force among the top one or two on the continent.","75":"Its commander is Princess Ishtar, feared as the Goddess of Thunder.","76":"And her second-in-command, Lord Reinhardt, is also a fine warrior, so much so that he is called the second coming of the Crusader Thrud.","77":"You call a man who lends a hand to child hunts \"fine\"?","78":"Honestly, knights are a nuisance. They know nothing of reality...","79":"August, is that not a rude way to speak! What do you say I do not know?","80":"Reinhardt is guardian to Princess Ishtar. Ishtar is Prince Julius's lover.","81":"And Julius is said to be the incarnation of the dark god Loptous.","82":"In other words, they are all servants of Loptous, those who would lead this world to destruction...","83":"That's not true! My brother... my brother Reinhardt is no servant of Loptous!!","84":"...And you are?","85":"Olwen... Reinhardt's sister...","86":"For certain reasons she is accompanying our army. I allowed it.","87":"Is that so. Then see it well with your own eyes.","88":"Just what manner of thing the Empire is.","89":"You shall not pass here! Take this!","90":"Glory to Friege... gah!","91":"This is how Leonster fights? Perhaps I was mistaken..."};
